# cjson test suite cross-compiled for armv7-a + NEON (hard-float) and run under
# qemu-arm-static — duck's --arm target drives the Linaro toolchain and emulates each
# binary. Static linking so qemu needs no sysroot. The simd_arm32 kernels replace the
# amd64 bodies under this build; the twin-identity suites are the safety net.
# duck honors only FULL-LINE comments; never trail a comment after a command line.
test tests/ -i include/micron/tests -i include/micron -i include/micron/src --arm -s -o bin/arm
